    + '\n\nRESEARCH_OK: ' + researchOk
    + '\n\nRESEARCH SUMMARY:\n' + researchSummary
    + '\n\nCITATIONS (the ONLY external URLs you may cite. Never invent one):\n' + citations
    + '\n\nINTERNAL LINK POOL (pool_size=' + poolSize + '. The ONLY internal URLs you may link to):\n' + pool
    + '\n\nCHART MAP (pre-classified by vision AI with alt-text):\n' + chartMap
    + '\n\nFor each section, if a chart is mapped to it (by sectionIndex), include its url as "chartRef" and its alt_text as "chartAlt". Only use charts from this map. Do NOT invent chart URLs.';
